repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/ecg-hrv
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- physiology
- autonomic
- cardiovascular
- ecg
- heart-rate-variability
- electrophysiology
- neuromodulation
- nerve-stimulation
- nwb
- neurokit2
- r-peak-detection
